{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE REAL TIME STRATEGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the next evolution of tower defense with Elemental Rush. Unlike traditional games in the genre, this fully 3D adventure lets you to explore the battlefield freely, adding a new layer of strategy to every wave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/extras/FinalmainGIF.gif?t=1749806585\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-- We have --</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>6 unique biomes</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>12 maps + a final level</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>3 difficulty levels for each map + endless mode</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>6 different elements of enemies and towers which are upgradable</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>3 unique enemy types</i> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-- So two battles are never the same --</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/extras/BiomGif.gif?t=1749806585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have six biomes, each with two levels. In each biome, you will encounter different enemies that come in waves, and you must strategically place towers to defend yourself. Towers will be unlocked gradually.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-- Endless Mode --</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong> is a brutal test of endurance and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies spawn endlessly \u2014 faster, stronger, and in larger numbers with each cycle. You can keep upgrading your towers infinitely, but every upgrade costs more than the last one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you keep up with the rising pressure, or will your defenses eventually crumble under the growing swarm?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342900?t=1749806585","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3342900?t=1749806585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/fbd89d898aba83c78030910c51d3da6992349213/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749806585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/fbd89d898aba83c78030910c51d3da6992349213/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749806585","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE REAL TIME STRATEGY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience the next evolution of tower defense with Elemental Rush. Unlike traditional games in the genre, this fully 3D adventure lets you to explore the battlefield freely, adding a new layer of strategy to every wave. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/extras/FinalmainGIF.gif?t=1749806585\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-- We have --</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>6 unique biomes</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>12 maps + a final level</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>3 difficulty levels for each map + endless mode</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>6 different elements of enemies and towers which are upgradable</i></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>3 unique enemy types</i> </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-- So two battles are never the same --</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/extras/BiomGif.gif?t=1749806585\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We have six biomes, each with two levels. In each biome, you will encounter different enemies that come in waves, and you must strategically place towers to defend yourself. Towers will be unlocked gradually.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>-- Endless Mode --</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Endless Mode</strong> is a brutal test of endurance and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemies spawn endlessly \u2014 faster, stronger, and in larger numbers with each cycle. You can keep upgrading your towers infinitely, but every upgrade costs more than the last one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you keep up with the rising pressure, or will your defenses eventually crumble under the growing swarm?</p>","developers":["SparkyByteGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3342900/10960fff8fe17a548c679cb4ba650e2edf78ae15/header.jpg?t=1749806585","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257152871,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152871/movie480.mp4?t=1749806583","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257152871/movie_max.mp4?t=1749806583"},"name":"Elemental Rush - Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257152871/ced6e8c27af50440c2d239d78e1a